<title>ITALY: Italian mutual funds post November inflow.</title>
<headline>Italian mutual funds post November inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 9.331 trillion lire in November, compared with a net inflow of 7.953 trillion lire recorded in October, Assogestioni, the industry body said.</p>
<p>				   November 1996     October 1996</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)	 6,529		6,843</p>
<p> Subscriptions		   15,861	     14,783</p>
<p>Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds		     -216		  -925</p>
<p>     of which Italian	    -28		  -159</p>
<p> Bond funds			9,714		 9,149</p>
<p>NOTE - Assogestioni in a note later revised slightly the October figure to give a net inflow of 7.940 trillion lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129450</p>
</text>
